35,2,1,talk,Midori,,I found that last winter’s outage sat unowned for two days.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I found the yard devices are a patchwork, and the 2021 trial failed.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,I found the dispatch tool skipped three upgrades because testing it all at once was too big.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"I found two admins are leaving, and the last rollout was quietly dropped in two depots.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I found the bundled price held, but the add-ons climbed every year, and the board trimmed capital while passing operating lines.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
